<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Entrar | WazeBR Monitor</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#f4f8fb;--ink:#0f172a;--muted:#64748b;--brand:#159bb2;--dark:#08768b;--line:#d9e4ea}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;color:var(--ink);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;background:radial-gradient(circle at 0 0,#159bb226,transparent 32%),radial-gradient(circle at 100% 100%,#8bd34f1f,transparent 30%),var(--bg)}a{color:inherit}.page{min-height:100vh;padding:20px 14px}.shell{width:min(1120px,100%);margin:auto}.brand{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:18px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:-.04em;text-decoration:none}.mark{display:grid;width:38px;height:38px;place-items:center;color:#fff;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand),#53c6d1)}.grid{display:grid;gap:18px}.hero,.card{overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #ffffffcc;border-radius:26px;box-shadow:0 24px 70px #0f172a1f}.hero{position:relative;min-height:270px;padding:28px;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0b3143,#0d6b82 55%,var(--brand))}.hero:before,.hero:after{position:absolute;border:1px solid #ffffff24;border-radius:50%;content:""}.hero:before{width:240px;height:240px;right:-80px;top:-70px}.hero:after{width:320px;height:320px;right:-120px;bottom:-150px}.hero-content{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:520px}.kicker{display:inline-flex;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #ffffff29;border-radius:999px;background:#ffffff1f;font-size:.74rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}.hero h1{margin:20px 0 12px;font-size:clamp(2.2rem,8vw,4rem);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.06em}.hero p{margin:0;color:#ffffffd1;line-height:1.6}.points{display:grid;gap:9px;margin-top:22px}.point{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:.9rem}.point i{display:grid;width:20px;height:20px;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;background:#ffffff26;font-style:normal}.card{padding:28px 18px;background:#fffffff0;backdrop-filter:blur(14px)}h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.7rem;letter-spacing:-.04em}.subtitle{margin:0 0 24px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55}.group{margin-bottom:16px}label{display:block;margin-bottom:8px;color:#334155;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:700}.input-wrap{position:relative}.input-wrap>svg{position:absolute;left:14px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);color:#94a3b8;pointer-events:none}.input{width:100%;min-height:50px;padding:0 46px 0 42px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);font:inherit;outline:0}.input:focus{border-color:#159bb2b3;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px #159bb21f}.toggle{position:absolute;right:8px;top:50%;display:grid;width:36px;height:36px;place-items:center;transform:translateY(-50%);border:0;border-radius:10px;background:transparent;color:#64748b;cursor:pointer}.toggle:hover,.toggle:focus-visible{background:#e8f7f8;color:var(--dark);outline:0}.toggle svg{width:18px;height:18px}.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin:14px 0 18px}.remember{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;color:#334155;font-size:.92rem}.remember input{width:18px;height:18px;accent-color:var(--brand)}.forgot{color:var(--dark);font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}.forgot:hover{text-decoration:underline}.alert{margin:0 0 16px;padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #fecdd3;border-radius:14px;background:#fff1f2;color:#9f1239;line-height:1.5}.submit{width:100%;min-height:52px;border:0;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand),#53c6d1);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 16px 32px #159bb238}.submit:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 20px 36px #159bb247}.support{margin-top:16px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;text-align:center}.support a{color:var(--dark);font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}.note{margin-top:14px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.5;text-align:center}@media(min-width:860px){.page{padding:32px 24px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr}.hero{min-height:650px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:40px}.card{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:40px}.card-inner{width:100%}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*:before,*:after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
</style>
<div class="page"><div class="shell"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="WazeBR Monitor início"><span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">⌁</span><span>WazeBR Monitor</span></a><main class="grid"><section class="hero" aria-label="Apresentação do sistema"><div class="hero-content"><span class="kicker">Acesso seguro</span><h1>Bem-vindo de volta.</h1><p>Acesse o painel de monitoramento para acompanhar alertas, rotas e dados operacionais em tempo real.</p><div class="points"><div class="point"><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i><span>Monitoramento centralizado</span></div><div class="point"><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i><span>Interface rápida e responsiva</span></div><div class="point"><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i><span>Feito para uso diário da equipe</span></div></div></div></section><section class="card" aria-label="Formulário de login"><div class="card-inner"><h2>Entrar no sistema</h2><p class="subtitle">Use suas credenciais para acessar o painel.</p>{% if error %}<div class="alert">{{ error.messageKey|trans(error.messageData, 'security') }}</div>{% endif %}<form method="post" action="{{ path('auth_login') }}"><div class="group"><label for="email">E-mail</label><div class="input-wrap"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"></rect><path d="m3 7 9 6 9-6"></path></svg><input class="input" type="email" id="email" name="email" value="{{ last_username }}" autocomplete="email" required autofocus></div></div><div class="group"><label for="password">Senha</label><div class="input-wrap"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="11" width="16" height="9" rx="2"></rect><path d="M8 11V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"></path></svg><input class="input" type="password" id="password" name="_password" autocomplete="current-password" required><button class="toggle" id="toggle-password" type="button" aria-label="Mostrar senha" aria-pressed="false"><svg id="eye-open" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M2 12s3.5-6 10 6 10 6-10 6S2 12 2 12Z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.5"></circle></svg><svg id="eye-closed" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="display:none"><path d="m3 3 18 18"></path><path d="M10.6 5.1A10.8 10.8 0 0 1 12 5c6.5 0 10 7 10 7a18 18 0 0 1-3.1 3.8M6.2 6.2C3.4 8.2 2 12 2 12s3.5 7 10 7c1.4 0 2.7-.3 3.8-.8"></path><path d="M9.9 9.9a3 3 0 0 0 4.2 4.2"></path></svg></button></div></div><input type="hidden" name="_csrf_token" value="{{ csrf_token('authenticate') }}"><div class="row"><label class="remember"><input type="checkbox" name="_remember_me"><span>Lembrar acesso</span></label><a class="forgot" href="/esqueci-senha">Esqueceu a senha?</a></div><button class="submit" type="submit">Entrar</button></form><div class="support">Problemas? <a href="mailto:suporte@wazebr.com">Fale com o suporte</a></div><div class="note">Ao entrar, você aceita o uso interno da plataforma para operação e monitoramento.</div></div></section></main></div></div><script>const t=document.getElementById('toggle-password'),p=document.getElementById('password'),o=document.getElementById('eye-open'),c=document.getElementById('eye-closed');if(t){t.addEventListener('click',()=>{const show=p.type==='password';p.type=show?'text':'password';o.style.display=show?'none':'block';c.style.display=show?'block':'none';t.setAttribute('aria-label',show?'Ocultar senha':'Mostrar senha');t.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(show));});}</script>
</body>
</html>